       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A company, a collection,</i> or <i>an assemblage:</i> (K:) or <i>a party,</i> or <i>company, of men,</i> (S, K,) peculiarly: (TA:) as also
